      "readme_lead": "# Muse BF16 projection — H200 development\n\nIndependent kernel candidate for `muse_bf16_proj`, targeting the Muse Spark Open\nKernel Challenge. **Best observed official off-board result: 1.162x speedup,\n4,157.4 µs, all nine correctness tests passed** (job `5cb5acb9d0a347fb`).\nThe router uses fused split-K for M<128 and a single packed high/low\nBF16 GEMM with FP32 output at M>=128. No leaderboard submission has been made.\n\n| Metric | Result |\n| --- | --- |\n| Official baseline | 4.8308 ms in a public October 24 API snapshot; live unverified |\n| Current leaderboard target | 2.93 ms user-supplied target; live rank unverified |\n| Best official-check latency | 4.1574 ms (job `5cb5acb9d0a347fb`) |\n| Best observed official-check speedup | 1.162x; 95%"
